{
 "0001": {
  "title": "1. Introduction",
  "nodes": [
   {
    "id": "h2_00001",
    "type": "h2",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     7
    ],
    "text": "[A1][/A1]1. Introduction",
    "placeholders": {
     "A1": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_15\" id=\"tag_15\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00002",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     9
    ],
    "text": "The System Interfaces volume of POSIX.1-2024 describes the interfaces offered to application programs by POSIX-conformant\nsystems.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   }
  ]
 },
 "0002": {
  "title": "1.1 Relationship to Other Formal Standards",
  "nodes": [
   {
    "id": "h3_00003",
    "type": "h3",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[A2][/A2]1.1 Relationship to Other Formal Standards",
    "placeholders": {
     "A2": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_15_01\" id=\"tag_15_01\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00004",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     13
    ],
    "text": "This volume of POSIX.1-2024 is aligned with the following standards, except where stated otherwise:",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00005",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     15,
     3
    ],
    "text": "ISO C (C17)",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00006",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     15,
     5
    ],
    "text": "ISO/IEC 9899:2018, Programming Languages — C.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00007",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     17
    ],
    "text": "Parts of the ISO/IEC&nbsp;9899:2018 standard (hereinafter referred to as the ISO&nbsp;C standard) are referenced to describe\nrequirements also mandated by this volume of POSIX.1-2024. Some functions and headers included within this volume of POSIX.1-2024\nhave a version in the ISO&nbsp;C standard; in this case CX markings are added as appropriate to show where the ISO&nbsp;C standard\nhas been extended (see [A3][I4]1.8.1 Codes[/I4][/A3]). Any conflict between this volume\nof POSIX.1-2024 and the ISO&nbsp;C standard is unintentional, except where stated otherwise.",
    "placeholders": {
     "A3": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../basedefs/V1_chap01.html#tag_01_08_01\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I4": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00008",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     19
    ],
    "text": "This volume of POSIX.1-2024 also allows, but does not require, mathematics functions to support IEEE&nbsp;Std&nbsp;754-1985 and\nIEEE&nbsp;Std&nbsp;854-1987.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   }
  ]
 },
 "0003": {
  "title": "1.2 Format of Entries",
  "nodes": [
   {
    "id": "h3_00009",
    "type": "h3",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21
    ],
    "text": "[A5][/A5]1.2 Format of Entries",
    "placeholders": {
     "A5": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_15_02\" id=\"tag_15_02\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00010",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     23
    ],
    "text": "The entries in [A6][I7]3. System Interfaces[/I7][/A6] are based on a common format as\nfollows. The only sections relating to conformance are the SYNOPSIS, DESCRIPTION, RETURN VALUE, and ERRORS sections.",
    "placeholders": {
     "A6": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/V2_chap03.html#tag_17\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I7": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00011",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     3
    ],
    "text": "[B8]NAME[/B8]",
    "placeholders": {
     "B8": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00012",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     5
    ],
    "text": "This section gives the name or names of the entry and briefly states its purpose.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00013",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     7
    ],
    "text": "[B9]SYNOPSIS[/B9]",
    "placeholders": {
     "B9": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "blockquote_00014",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     9,
     1
    ],
    "text": "[PRE10]",
    "placeholders": {
     "PRE10": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<pre>\n<tt>#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n</tt></pre>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00015",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[B11]DESCRIPTION[/B11]",
    "placeholders": {
     "B11": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00016",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     13
    ],
    "text": "This section describes the functionality of the function or header.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00017",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[B12]RETURN VALUE[/B12]",
    "placeholders": {
     "B12": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00018",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     17,
     1
    ],
    "text": "If the implementation can detect errors, &quot;successful completion&quot; means that no error has been detected during execution of the\nfunction. If the implementation does detect an error, the error is indicated.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00019",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     17,
     3
    ],
    "text": "For functions where no errors are defined, &quot;successful completion&quot; means that if the implementation checks for errors, no\nerror has been detected. If the implementation can detect errors, and an error is detected, the indicated return value is returned\nand [I13]errno[/I13] may be set.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I13": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00020",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[B14]ERRORS[/B14]",
    "placeholders": {
     "B14": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00021",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     21,
     3
    ],
    "text": "&quot;No errors are defined&quot; means that error values returned by a function or stored into a variable accessed through the symbol\n[I15]errno[/I15], if any, depend on the implementation.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I15": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00022",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     23
    ],
    "text": "[B16]EXAMPLES[/B16]",
    "placeholders": {
     "B16": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00023",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     25,
     1
    ],
    "text": "This section gives examples of usage, where appropriate. In the event of conflict between an example and a normative part of\nthis volume of POSIX.1-2024, the normative material is to be taken as correct.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00024",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     27
    ],
    "text": "[B17]APPLICATION USAGE[/B17]",
    "placeholders": {
     "B17": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00025",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     29,
     1
    ],
    "text": "This section gives warnings and advice to application developers about the entry. In the event of conflict between warnings and\nadvice and a normative part of this volume of POSIX.1-2024, the normative material is to be taken as correct.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00026",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     31
    ],
    "text": "[B18]RATIONALE[/B18]",
    "placeholders": {
     "B18": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00027",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     33,
     1
    ],
    "text": "This section contains historical information concerning the contents of this volume of POSIX.1-2024 and why features were\nincluded or discarded by the standard developers.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00028",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     35
    ],
    "text": "[B19]FUTURE DIRECTIONS[/B19]",
    "placeholders": {
     "B19": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00029",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     37,
     1
    ],
    "text": "This section provides comments which should be used as a guide to current thinking; there is not necessarily a commitment to\nadopt these future directions.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00030",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     39
    ],
    "text": "[B20]SEE ALSO[/B20]",
    "placeholders": {
     "B20": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00031",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     41,
     1
    ],
    "text": "This section gives references to related information.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00032",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     43
    ],
    "text": "[B21]CHANGE HISTORY[/B21]",
    "placeholders": {
     "B21": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00033",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     45,
     1
    ],
    "text": "This section shows the derivation of the entry and any significant changes that have been made to it.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
